sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant MW as Auth Middleware
    participant KMS as KMS Core
    participant DB as Database

    Note over MW: Supported auth methods:<br/>JWT (OIDC/Entra), mTLS, API Token

    C->>+MW: HTTPS Request\n(KMIP / REST)
    alt JWT Bearer
        MW->>MW: Verify JWT signature\n& expiry (JWKS endpoint)
    else mTLS Client Certificate
        MW->>MW: Validate client cert\nagainst trust store
    else API Token
        MW->>MW: Hash & compare\nstored token
    end
    MW->>+KMS: Authenticated identity\n(owner / group / role)
    KMS->>+DB: Check access policy\n(object ownership + grants)
    DB-->>-KMS: Permitted
    KMS-->>-MW: Crypto response
    MW-->>-C: KMIP / JSON response
